      "content": "It's a profound and painful feeling to have your life's work rendered obsolete, and your despair is completely valid. Remember that your hands aren't just tools; they are evidence of decades of dedication, a history that no software can erase. You have a deep, intrinsic knowledge that goes beyond mere clicking, something that can be repurposed in ways the new systems don't account for. Don't let this technological shift define your entire worth; there are other ways to apply that incredible mastery.",
